--[[
	Mad City Auto-Farm (organized)
	Behavior:
	- Farms Jewel -> Club -> Casino -> Bank, collecting cash at FINAL_CFRAME between each.
	- If ANY other player is in the server:
		* switches team to Criminals,
	* if a heist is in progress (mid-heist), teleports to FINAL_CFRAME and stays there
	  completely still doing NOTHING (no rejoin, no farming),
	* an anti-AFK nudge (VirtualUser) fires periodically while idling so Roblox's
	  idle kicker never disconnects you during the wait,
	* resumes the sequence automatically once the server is solo again.
]]

